{"version":1,"content":"<p>將肉類、海鮮及蔬菜串起、裹上麵包糠酥炸的大阪串炸，向來是人氣平民美食，近年愈做愈精緻。</p><p>北新地有高級串炸店以A5和牛、海膽及魚子醬入饌。</p><p>梅田另一間則主打四季旬味，將松茸、鱧魚等食材配搭創意醬汁，帶來味覺驚喜。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;------</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.937382+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"c3899bba5e40893f31673d0b8b636cbe733c34f57f88f071fee44bb183a7411a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}